        "source_id": "bakry-emery-gradient-contraction:abstract-bakry-emery-gradient-contraction",
        "anchor": "Samplinglib abstract backward-interpolation composition",
        "url": "https://chewisinho.github.io/main.pdf#page=31",
        "original_text": "Let X be any type and L a real-linear operator on real-valued functions. Let alpha>0 and assume the fully expanded diagonal curvature inequality alpha Gamma(g,g) <= one half of L Gamma(g,g) minus Gamma(g,Lg) minus Gamma(g,Lg), for every g and state. Let P_u be real-linear operators preserving pointwise order, q_u a real-time family of observables, and x a state. Assume Phi(u)=P_u Gamma(q_u,q_u)(x) is continuous and has exact right derivative within [u,infinity) equal to P_u(L Gamma(q_u,q_u)-2 Gamma(q_u,Lq_u))(x) for every u. Then for s<=t, Phi(s)<=Phi(t) exp(-2 alpha (t-s)). No semigroup construction or derivative proof is included.",
        "text_sha256": "7e5ed2625672e15389517f15015f6563f635ec8915a22b08ea6f67256715b900"
      },
      "lean": {
        "declaration": "AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.StochasticProcesses.backwardInterpolation_contraction_of_expandedBakryEmery",
        "file": "AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/StochasticProcesses/BakryEmeryGradientContraction.lean",
        "statement": "theorem backwardInterpolation_contraction_of_expandedBakryEmery\n    (generator : (X → ℝ) →ₗ[ℝ] (X → ℝ))\n    {alpha : ℝ} (halpha : 0 < alpha)\n    (hcurvature : ∀ (g : X → ℝ) (y : X),\n      alpha * carreDuChamp generator g g y ≤\n        (2 : ℝ)⁻¹ *\n          (generator (carreDuChamp generator g g) y -\n            carreDuChamp generator g (generator g) y -\n            carreDuChamp generator g (generator g) y))\n    (evolution : ℝ → (X → ℝ) →ₗ[ℝ] (X → ℝ))\n    (orbit : ℝ → X → ℝ) (x : X)\n    (hpositive : ∀ u : ℝ, ∀ {f g : X → ℝ},\n      (∀ y, f y ≤ g y) → ∀ z, evolution u f z ≤ evolution u g z)\n    (hcontinuous : Continuous (fun u =>\n      evolution u (carreDuChamp generator (orbit u) (orbit u)) x))\n    (hderiv : ∀ u : ℝ,\n      HasDerivWithinAt\n        (fun v => evolution v\n          (carreDuChamp generator (orbit v) (orbit v)) x)\n        (evolution u\n          (generator (carreDuChamp generator (orbit u) (orbit u)) -\n            (2 : ℝ) • carreDuChamp generator (orbit u) (generator (orbit u))) x)\n        (Ici u) u)\n    {s t : ℝ} (hst : s ≤ t) :\n    evolution s (carreDuChamp generator (orbit s) (orbit s)) x ≤\n      evolution t (carreDuChamp generator (orbit t) (orbit t)) x *\n        Real.exp (-(2 * alpha) * (t - s))",
        "statement_sha256": "191c78ecbbdaf166098465aa08fb991a2c7bb2265baf0fc0efe2bfabb9824052",
        "compiled": true,
        "formalizer": "root",
        "compiler_evidence": "Focused production module and Tests/BakryEmeryGradientContraction.lean passed with Lean 4.33.0.",
